ute $y=0$ into the equation of the parabola and solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-3)^{2} & =4(0+4) \\\\ (x-3)^{2} & =16 \\\\ x-3 & =\\pm 4 \\\\ x & =\\pm 4+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the $x$-intercepts are $7$ and $-1.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395844 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395845 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395846 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395847 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1075 #edb/ref 17592186395848 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1079 #edb/ref 17592186395845 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395843 1080 #uuid "1984d219-413d-5333-ac39-1acd7d9d0ec5" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395844 1081 "$8$ and $-1$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395844 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395844 1084 #uuid "fbcf88a3-1e20-5a4c-bb86-1fe1bdaa1963" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395845 1081 "$7$ and $-1$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395845 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395845 1084 #uuid "ae0d6ea0-c5ed-5e7f-9687-ab98aef0c28b" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395846 1081 "$9$ and $-2$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395846 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395846 1084 #uuid "c4dc7a4e-aacb-5122-89ac-d5eb5d04a7da" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395847 1081 "$7$ and $-2$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395847 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186395847 1084 #uuid "950ec668-d2b7-5d89-8e4f-1d349b1209a4" 1319413