oots of the characteristic polynomial, $A$ is diagonalizable. \n\nWe construct a diagonal matrix $D$ by writing the eigenvalues in the main diagonal. Therefore, one possible matrix $D$ is\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}-9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,-3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNote that the diagonal matrix $D$ is unique up to the ordering of the eigenvalues. Therefore, another possible diagonal matrix is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\,\\,-9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396329 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396330 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396331 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396332 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396333 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396330 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396328 1080 #uuid "72ff45fc-3165-5e0a-8ffa-750ac771413e" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396329 1081 "D=[\\begin{aligned}9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396329 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396329 1084 #uuid "89f3e2af-1d0c-5ede-94d8-b2f1171885f8" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396330 1081 "D=[\\begin{aligned}-9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396330 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396330 1084 #uuid "aea3c10a-5a5b-5b56-ac38-0531c16322a6" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396331 1081 "D=[\\begin{aligned}-9 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\