oint." 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396565 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396566 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396567 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396568 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396569 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396567 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396564 1080 #uuid "0e5117de-56c6-5e2d-bbc7-db8ca53a8c13" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396565 1081 "(0,1)" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396565 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396565 1084 #uuid "dbace19d-5367-5c93-b9b0-ff6aeb65e1d1" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396566 1081 "(0,-1)" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396566 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396566 1084 #uuid "f6af0e69-ff28-55e7-b6dc-a821f4b217f3" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396567 1081 "There is no $y$-intercept" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396567 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396567 1084 #uuid "527f983e-7dc1-5b2b-9188-ce7384cd5c7d" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396568 1081 "$(0,-3)$ and $(0,2)$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396568 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396568 1084 #uuid "f75f14cb-aeb0-550a-ae72-cab73f53cf15" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396569 1081 "$(0,-2)$ and $(0,3)$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396569 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396569 1084 #uuid "819ac8b9-5d96-5ef6-b9ec-c7d3ea4555b2" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1068 #edb/ref 17592186396571 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1069 "q-9913" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1071 "Find the possible values of the constant $k$ given that the matrix  $[\\begin{aligned}k & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 6 & k\\end{aligned}]$ is singular." 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1072 #uuid "11af43ea-89bf-58ea-b458-4433226aa764" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396570 1074 "First, let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $k:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}k & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 6 & k\\end{aligned}| & =k|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 6 & k\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & k\\end{aligned}|+0|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =k(3k-6)+0+0 \\\\  & =k(3k-6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the matrix is singular, the determinant is $0.$ So,  we have:\n\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k(3k-6) & =0 \\\\ 3k(k-2) & =0 \\\\ k & =0,2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $k=0$ and $k=2.$" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396572 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396573 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396574 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396575 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1075 #edb/ref 17592186396576 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1077 "selection" 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1079 #edb/ref 17592186396575 13194139533466 17592186045585 true] [17592186396571 1080 #uuid "0631763f-bf07-54e2-9810-4d0b16208a88" 13194139533466 17592